\b Quota Group Planning and Movement Flow\b0\par
\par
\b Purpose\b0\par
This guide captures the quota group workflow implemented and validated in this repo:\par
- identify unused quota capacity\par
- generate safe movement candidates\par
- move quota within a quota group\par
- return unused subscription quota back to group context\par
- monitor asynchronous request completion\par
\par
This document is sanitized for handoff (no tenant-specific IDs, credentials, or user data).\par
\par
\b Key Point About Region\b0\par
Quota allocation updates are region-scoped.\par
A change in centralus does not change eastus, westus, or any other region.\par
\par
\b RegionPreset Definition and Options\b0\par
Where this is defined:\par
- Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 defines RegionPresets in the RegionPresets map.\par
- Parameter validation list is also defined in Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1.\par
\par
Current RegionPreset options:\par
- USEastWest: eastus, westus2\par
- USCentral: centralus, southcentralus\par
- USMajor: eastus, eastus2, centralus, westus, westus2\par
- Europe: westeurope, northeurope, uksouth, ukwest, francecentral, germanywestcentral\par
- AsiaPacific: eastasia, southeastasia, japaneast, japanwest, australiaeast, australiasoutheast\par
- Global: all enabled regions from Get-AzLocation (current cloud)\par
- USGov: usgovvirginia, usgovtexas, usgovarizona\par
- China: chinaeast2, chinanorth2\par
- ASR-EastWest: eastus2, westus2\par
- ASR-CentralUS: centralus\par
\par
Can this be used for US Gov?\par
- Yes. Use RegionPreset USGov.\par
- USGov auto-sets AzureUSGovernment when Environment is not explicitly set.\par
- You still need to authenticate to Azure Government.\par
\par
US Gov baseline command example:\par
Connect-AzAccount -Environment AzureUSGovernment\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USGov -CaptureQuotaHistory -QuotaGroupCandidates\par
\par
\b Hourly Baseline Capture\b0\par
Run:\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -CaptureQuotaHistory -QuotaGroupCandidates\par
\par
\b Discover and Plan\b0\par
Run discovery:\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -CaptureQuotaHistory -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupDiscover\par
\par
Generate plan:\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupPlan -QuotaGroupManagementGroupId <management-group-id> -QuotaGroupName <quota-group-name>\par
\par
\b Apply and Verify\b0\par
Apply from script plan:\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupPlan -QuotaGroupApply -QuotaGroupForceConfirm -QuotaGroupManagementGroupId <management-group-id> -QuotaGroupName <quota-group-name>\par
\par
Direct API paths:\par
GET .../quotaAllocations/{location}?api-version=2025-09-01\par
PATCH .../quotaAllocations/{location}?api-version=2025-09-01\par
GET .../quotaAllocationRequests?...&$filter=location eq {location}\par
GET .../quotaAllocationRequests/{allocationId}?api-version=2025-09-01\par
\par
\b Async and Error Handling\b0\par
- Updates can be asynchronous (202 Accepted).\par
- Poll quotaAllocationRequests until terminal state.\par
- Handle RequestThrottled with Retry-After.\par
- Handle EntityAlreadyExists by reusing existing request id and polling.\par
\par
\b Scale Guidance for 1000+ Subscriptions\b0\par
- Measure one real run and compute seconds per subscription.\par
- Project total runtime for N subscriptions.\par
- Batch subscriptions (for example 100-250 per run).\par
- Stagger schedules to reduce throttling.\par
\par
\b Suggested Batch Model\b0\par
1000 subscriptions -> 10 tasks x 100 subscriptions, staggered hourly starts.\par
\par
\b Full Example Commands\b0\par
\par
\b 1) Hourly baseline capture (history + candidates)\b0\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -CaptureQuotaHistory -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupMinMovable 20 -QuotaGroupSafetyBuffer 10 -QuotaHistoryPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaHistory" -QuotaGroupReportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaGroupCandidates" -ExportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability" -OutputFormat CSV -JsonOutput -MaxRetries 4 -Verbose\par
\par
\b 2) Discover groups and generate candidate data\b0\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -CaptureQuotaHistory -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupDiscover -QuotaGroupMinMovable 15 -QuotaGroupSafetyBuffer 12 -QuotaHistoryPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaHistory" -QuotaGroupReportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaGroupCandidates" -ExportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability" -JsonOutput -MaxRetries 4 -Verbose\par
\par
\b 3) Build quota move plan for selected group\b0\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupPlan -QuotaGroupManagementGroupId "<management-group-id>" -QuotaGroupName "<quota-group-name>" -QuotaGroupMinMovable 10 -QuotaGroupSafetyBuffer 10 -QuotaHistoryPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaHistory" -QuotaGroupReportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaGroupCandidates" -ExportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability" -OutputFormat CSV -JsonOutput -MaxRetries 4 -Verbose\par
\par
\b 4) Apply plan rows (automation mode)\b0\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USMajor -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupPlan -QuotaGroupApply -QuotaGroupForceConfirm -QuotaGroupApplyMaxRows 5 -QuotaGroupManagementGroupId "<management-group-id>" -QuotaGroupName "<quota-group-name>" -QuotaGroupMinMovable 10 -QuotaGroupSafetyBuffer 10 -QuotaHistoryPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaHistory" -QuotaGroupReportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaGroupCandidates" -ExportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability" -JsonOutput -MaxRetries 5 -Verbose\par
\par
\b 5) Large-estate batch mode (explicit subscription list)\b0\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -SubscriptionId "<sub-id-1>","<sub-id-2>","<sub-id-3>" -RegionPreset USMajor -CaptureQuotaHistory -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupPlan -QuotaGroupManagementGroupId "<management-group-id>" -QuotaGroupName "<quota-group-name>" -QuotaGroupMinMovable 20 -QuotaGroupSafetyBuffer 15 -QuotaHistoryPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaHistory\Batch01" -QuotaGroupReportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaGroupCandidates\Batch01" -ExportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\Batch01" -JsonOutput -MaxRetries 4 -Verbose\par
\par
\b 6) US Gov full example\b0\par
Connect-AzAccount -Environment AzureUSGovernment\par
.\Get-AzVMAvailability.ps1 -NoPrompt -AllSubscriptions -RegionPreset USGov -CaptureQuotaHistory -QuotaGroupCandidates -QuotaGroupPlan -QuotaGroupManagementGroupId "<gov-management-group-id>" -QuotaGroupName "<gov-quota-group-name>" -QuotaGroupMinMovable 20 -QuotaGroupSafetyBuffer 10 -QuotaHistoryPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaHistoryGov" -QuotaGroupReportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\QuotaGroupCandidatesGov" -ExportPath "C:\Temp\AzVMAvailability\Gov" -JsonOutput -MaxRetries 5 -Verbose\par
\par
\b 7) Generate and import scheduled tasks\b0\par
.\tools\New-QuotaPlanningScheduledTasks.ps1 -RepositoryPath "C:\repos\Capacity\Get-AzVMAvailability" -OutputPath "C:\repos\Capacity\Get-AzVMAvailability\artifacts\scheduled-tasks" -TaskPrefix "AzVMAvailability" -RegionPreset "USMajor" -ManagementGroupId "<management-group-id>" -GroupQuotaName "<quota-group-name>" -DailyPlanHour 6\par
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\artifacts\scheduled-tasks\Import-QuotaPlanningScheduledTasks.ps1\par
\par
\b 8) Direct API allocation request runner with polling\b0\par
pwsh .\examples\QuotaGroup-AllocationRequest-Example.ps1 -ManagementGroupId "<management-group-id>" -QuotaGroupName "<quota-group-name>" -SubscriptionId "<subscription-id-guid>" -Region "centralus" -ResourceName "standardbsfamily" -TargetLimit 79 -MaxPollAttempts 30 -PollIntervalSeconds 10\par
